      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing Moderation Code**\n\nI've just finished the `moderate_batch.py` file, which includes the requested functionality. My code uses the Google Cloud Language client to moderate text. It goes through a list of messages, sends each one to the moderation API, then gathers the results.\n\n\n**Implementing Batch Moderation**\n\nI've successfully created `moderate_batch.py` using the Google Cloud Language client for text moderation. My code now iterates through a list of messages, submits each to the `moderate_text` API, and collects the returned moderation categories along with their corresponding confidence scores. This completes the core functionality requested in the prompt.\n\n\n",
